# Cloudflare Workers Assets: files to skip during upload.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/binding/#assetsignore
#
# /dev/ is our internal scratch. robots.txt Disallows it and every page has
# noindex, but until it stops being deployed the URLs return HTTP 200 to
# any human who types them. Excluding here means /dev/* requests fall
# through to not_found_handling: "404-page" and return a real 404.

dev/**
